---
/**
 * Knowledge Hub page: Introduction section.
 */
---

<section
  class="w-full bg-white px-6 py-7 sm:px-8 md:py-9 lg:py-10"
  aria-labelledby="knowledge-hub-title"
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-vb">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <h1
        id="knowledge-hub-title"
        class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-vb-navy sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
      >
        Knowledge Hub
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-1.5 font-sans text-base italic text-vb-blue sm:text-lg">
        Thinking that helps you decide better
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-3 max-w-4xl font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-vb-text sm:text-base sm:leading-7"
      >
        The VentureBean Knowledge Hub brings together our perspectives, tools,
        and public work in one place. It is designed for founders, CXOs, and
        leadership teams dealing with real business decisions. The content
        focuses on clarity, judgment, and practical thinking. Everything here
        is shaped by advisory and leadership work across industries. The goal
        is to help leaders focus and move forward with intent and confidence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
